# Local manual checks only. Replace IDs with synthetic local records.
# Use an authorized local test identity; never copy production credentials here.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@systemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000981
@subscriptionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000982
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_TOKEN

### Readiness: a missing attachment returns isReady=false and configuration guidance.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/assessment-readiness
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read actual Azure attachment and organization registration choices.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/assessment-environment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save attachment metadata; the subscription must already be eligible in this organization.
# Saving is not a claim of connectivity and must not create an assessment.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/assessment-environment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cloudEnvironment": "Government",
  "subscriptionIds": ["{{subscriptionId}}"]
}

### Reject malformed scope without saving configuration.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/assessment-environment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cloudEnvironment": "Government",
  "subscriptionIds": ["not-a-subscription"]
}

### Detach local configuration without changing historical assessments.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/assessment-environment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Direct API bypass regression: after detach this must reject, never evaluate narratives.
# Do not send this against a connected production system.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/run-assessment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unknown system returns the structured SYSTEM_NOT_FOUND error.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/assessment-readiness
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
